<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-RESULTS IN THE SPANISH CUP QUARTER-FINALS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS IN THE SPANISH CUP QUARTER-FINALS.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Spanish Cup quarter-final, second-leg matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p> Barcelona  5  Atletico Madrid   4</p>
<p>(Barcelona win 7-6 on aggregate)</p>
<p> Espanyol  1  Las Palmas   1</p>
<p>(1-1 on aggregate, Las Palmas win on away goals rule)</p>
<p>Playing Thursday:</p>
<p>Rayo Vallecano v Real Betis (0-2 in first leg)</p>
<p>Celta Vigo v Racing Santander (2-1 in first leg)</p>
